{"seq":3,"slug":"copy-on-write","title":"写时复制","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mobile/swift-language-advanced/memory-model/copy-on-write","wordCount":823,"readingTime":4,"html":"<h1 id=\"写时复制\">写时复制</h1><h2 id=\"概述\">概述</h2><p>写时复制（Copy-on-Write, COW）是 Swift 值语义的核心优化策略。Swift 的 <code>Array</code>、<code>Dictionary</code>、<code>Set</code>、<code>String</code> 等标准库类型都使用 COW——复制时仅复制引用，只在真正修改时才创建独立副本。理解 COW 的实现原理和 <code>isKnownUniquelyReferenced</code> 的使用方式，可以帮助开发者为自定义类型实现高效的值语义。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    COW[&quot;写时复制 COW&quot;] --&gt; VS[&quot;值语义&quot;]&#10;    COW --&gt; LZ[&quot;延迟复制&quot;]&#10;    COW --&gt; IK[&quot;isKnownUniquelyReferenced&quot;]&#10;    COW --&gt; IMPL[&quot;自定义实现&quot;]&#10;    VS --&gt; SAFE[&quot;安全:独立副本&quot;]&#10;    LZ --&gt; PERF[&quot;高效:共享存储&quot;]\">flowchart TD\n    COW[\"写时复制 COW\"] --&gt; VS[\"值语义\"]\n    COW --&gt; LZ[\"延迟复制\"]\n    COW --&gt; IK[\"isKnownUniquelyReferenced\"]\n    COW --&gt; IMPL[\"自定义实现\"]\n    VS --&gt; SAFE[\"安全:独立副本\"]\n    LZ --&gt; PERF[\"高效:共享存储\"]</pre><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>写时复制（Copy-on-Write, COW）是 Swift 值语义得以「既安全又高效」的关键优化：值类型在赋值时<strong>只复制引用</strong>，只有在真正修改时才创建独立副本。它让 struct 表现出复制语义的同时，避免了每次赋值都物理复制整个存储。围绕它有几个关键概念：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>值语义与延迟复制</strong>——赋值是 O(1) 的引用共享，修改前先检查引用是否唯一，非唯一才复制存储（O(n)）；</li>\n<li><strong><code>isKnownUniquelyReferenced</code></strong>——实现 COW 的核心 API，判断内部引用类型存储是否只有一个持有者；</li>\n<li><strong>标准库 COW 类型</strong>——<code>Array</code>、<code>Dictionary</code>、<code>Set</code>、<code>String</code>、<code>Data</code> 均以引用类型存储 + COW 实现值语义；</li>\n<li><strong>自定义 COW 模式</strong>——用一个 <code>class</code> 内部存储 + struct 外壳，在 mutating 方法中调用唯一性检查；</li>\n<li><strong>性能特征</strong>——读取/赋值恒为 O(1)，首次写入共享存储为 O(n)，后续写入 O(1)。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>一句话概括：<strong>COW 用「共享引用 + 写前检查唯一性」把值语义的复制成本推迟到真正修改的那一刻。</strong></p>\n<h2 id=\"值语义与引用语义\">值语义与引用语义</h2><p>Swift 的值类型（struct、enum）具有值语义——赋值时创建独立副本：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"swift\" data-code=\"var array1 = [1, 2, 3]&#10;var array2 = array1       // 看起来是复制&#10;array2.append(4)&#10;&#10;print(array1) // [1, 2, 3] — 不受影响&#10;print(array2) // [1, 2, 3, 4]\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">var</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> array1 </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> [</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">3</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">var</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> array2 </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> array1       </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 看起来是复制</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">array2.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">append</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">4</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">print</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(array1) </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// [1, 2, 3] — 不受影响</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">print</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(array2) </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// [1, 2, 3, 4]</span></span></code></pre></div><p>但如果每次赋值都物理复制整个数组，性能会很差。COW 的策略是：</p>\n<ol>\n<li>赋值时只复制<strong>引用</strong>（O(1)）</li>\n<li>修改前检查引用是否唯一</li>\n<li>唯一引用：直接修改（O(1)）</li>\n<li>非唯一引用：先复制存储，再修改（O(n)）</li>\n</ol>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"sequenceDiagram\" data-source=\"sequenceDiagram&#10;    participant A as array1&#10;    participant B as array2&#10;    participant S as 共享存储&#10;    A-&gt;&gt;S: 引用&#10;    Note over A,S: var array2 = array1&#10;    B-&gt;&gt;S: 引用(引用计数 = 2)&#10;    Note over B: array2.append(4)&#10;    B-&gt;&gt;B: 检查:引用计数 &gt; 1&#10;    B-&gt;&gt;B: 复制存储&#10;    B-&gt;&gt;B: 在新存储上 append\">sequenceDiagram\n    participant A as array1\n    participant B as array2\n    participant S as 共享存储\n    A-&gt;&gt;S: 引用\n    Note over A,S: var array2 = array1\n    B-&gt;&gt;S: 引用(引用计数 = 2)\n    Note over B: array2.append(4)\n    B-&gt;&gt;B: 检查:引用计数 &gt; 1\n    B-&gt;&gt;B: 复制存储\n    B-&gt;&gt;B: 在新存储上 append</pre><hr>\n<h2 id=\"isknownuniquelyreferenced\">isKnownUniquelyReferenced</h2><p><code>isKnownUniquelyReferenced</code> 是实现 COW 的关键 API，它检查一个类实例是否只有一个引用：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"swift\" data-code=\"class Storage&lt;T&gt; {&#10;    var elements: [T]&#10;&#10;    init(_ elements: [T]) {&#10;        self.elements = elements&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    func copy() -&gt; Storage {&#10;        Storage(elements)&#10;    }&#10;}&#10;&#10;struct COWArray&lt;T&gt; {&#10;    private var storage: Storage&lt;T&gt;&#10;&#10;    init(_ elements: [T] = []) {&#10;        storage = Storage(elements)&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    var count: Int { storage.elements.count }&#10;&#10;    private mutating func ensureUnique() {&#10;        if !isKnownUniquelyReferenced(&amp;storage) {&#10;            storage = storage.copy()&#10;        }&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    mutating func append(_ element: T) {&#10;        ensureUnique()&#10;        storage.elements.append(element)&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    subscript(index: Int) -&gt; T {&#10;        get { storage.elements[index] }&#10;        set {&#10;            ensureUnique()&#10;            storage.elements[index] = newValue&#10;        }&#10;    }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">class</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Storage</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">T</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    var</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> elements: [T]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    init</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">_</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> elements: [T]) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">elements</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> elements</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    func</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> copy</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">() </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-></span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> Storage</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        Storage</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(elements)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">struct</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> COWArray</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">T</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    private</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> var</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> storage: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">Storage</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;T></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    init</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">_</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> elements: [T] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> []) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        storage </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> Storage</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(elements)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    var</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> count: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">Int</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { storage.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">elements</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">count</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    private</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> mutating</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> func</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> ensureUnique</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        if</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> !</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">isKnownUniquelyReferenced</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x26;</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">storage) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">            storage </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> storage.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">copy</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    mutating</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> func</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> append</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">_</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> element: T) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        ensureUnique</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        storage.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">elements</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">append</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(element)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    subscript</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">index</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">Int</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> T {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        get</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { storage.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">elements</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[index] }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        set</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">            ensureUnique</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">            storage.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">elements</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[index] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> newValue</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>使用示例：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"swift\" data-code=\"var a = COWArray([1, 2, 3])&#10;var b = a                    // 共享同一个 Storage（引用计数 = 2）&#10;b.append(4)                  // 触发 ensureUnique → 复制 Storage&#10;print(a.count) // 3&#10;print(b.count) // 4\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">var</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> a </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> COWArray</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">([</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">3</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">])</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">var</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> b </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> a                    </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 共享同一个 Storage（引用计数 = 2）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">b.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">append</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">4</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)                  </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 触发 ensureUnique → 复制 Storage</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">print</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(a.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">count</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 3</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">print</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(b.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">count</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 4</span></span></code></pre></div><hr>\n<h2 id=\"标准库-cow-类型\">标准库 COW 类型</h2><p>Swift 标准库中以下类型全部使用 COW：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>类型</th>\n<th>内部存储</th>\n<th>COW 触发条件</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>Array</code></td>\n<td><code>_ArrayBuffer</code></td>\n<td>任何 mutating 操作</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>Dictionary</code></td>\n<td><code>_NativeDictionary</code></td>\n<td>插入、删除、修改</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>Set</code></td>\n<td><code>_NativeSet</code></td>\n<td>插入、删除</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>String</code></td>\n<td><code>_StringGuts</code></td>\n<td>任何 mutating 操作</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>Data</code></td>\n<td><code>_DataStorage</code></td>\n<td>任何 mutating 操作</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>验证 COW 行为：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"swift\" data-code=\"var original = [1, 2, 3, 4, 5]&#10;let copy = original&#10;&#10;print(original.withUnsafeBufferPointer { $0.baseAddress! })&#10;print(copy.withUnsafeBufferPointer { $0.baseAddress! })&#10;// 相同地址 — 共享存储&#10;&#10;original.append(6)&#10;print(original.withUnsafeBufferPointer { $0.baseAddress! })&#10;// 不同地址 — 修改触发了复制\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">var</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> original </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> [</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">3</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">4</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">5</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">let</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> copy </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--